{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "root": "data/warm/provider-bank/",
  "doctrine": [
    "The small keyed providers the audit (2026-10-23) found at 0-30% use - Trading Economics (a FRED mirror and a latest-value snapshot; no calendar, forecasts, markets, news, comtrade, earnings, ratings), CoinMarketCap (snapshots only; no map/info/categories/historical), NewsAPI (page 1 of two endpoints), Nasdaq Data Link (24 FRED mirrors, no trigger) and CryptoQuant (all-exchange daily only; no per-exchange, per-miner or hourly) - banked here, verbatim JSON (gz), under data/warm/provider-bank/<provider>/<dataset>/...",
    "Plans are unknown from the repo: every dataset is a probe whose verdict is recorded by http code (402/403/426 = not in the plan), skipped for the day and re-probed tomorrow. The card on data.html says what the key can and cannot reach.",
    "Per-provider daily call caps keep paid credits and free quotas inside their month (CMC credits, NewsAPI requests/day); the token bucket keeps each provider under its per-second limit.",
    "kinds: list (every run; latest + dated when changed or dated_always), window (from/to by month, backfill from floor), per_entity (one file per entity, rotation by cursor; chunked ids for batch endpoints), latest_pages (paged newest-first feed, pages until short).",
    "v1.1.0 (2026-10-25, first live run): TE keys are user:secret and the colon must stay unencoded (401 otherwise); CryptoQuant rejects limit>1000 (400); NewsAPI's free quota is spent by the fleet's own engines before noon UTC - this bank asks for 8 feeds a day and stops on the first 429; Nasdaq Data Link's listing endpoints answer 410/403 on this key, so datasets come from a static code list and each is probed."
  ],
  "providers": {
    "te": {
      "base": "https://api.tradingeconomics.com",
      "auth": {
        "query": "c"
      },
      "key_env": [
        "TE_API_KEY",
        "TE_API",
        "TRADINGECONOMICS_API_KEY"
      ],
      "key_ssm": [
        "/justhodl/te_api"
      ],
      "extra_query": {
        "f": "json"
      },
      "rps": 1.0,
      "daily_call_cap": 1500,
      "paging": null
    },
    "cmc": {
      "base": "https://pro-api.coinmarketcap.com",
      "auth": {
        "header": "X-CMC_PRO_API_KEY"
      },
      "key_env": [
        "CMC_KEY",
        "CMC_PRO_API_KEY",
        "COINMARKETCAP_API_KEY"
      ],
      "key_ssm": [
        "/justhodl/cmc/api-key"
      ],
      "rps": 0.5,
      "daily_call_cap": 110,
      "paging": {
        "param": "start",
        "start": 1,
        "size_param": "limit",
        "size": 5000,
        "mode": "offset"
      },
      "results_key": "data"
    },
    "newsapi": {
      "base": "https://newsapi.org",
      "auth": {
        "header": "X-Api-Key"
      },
      "key_env": [
        "NEWSAPI_KEY",
        "NEWS_API_KEY"
      ],
      "key_ssm": [
        "/justhodl/newsapi/api-key"
      ],
      "rps": 1.0,
      "daily_call_cap": 20,
      "paging": {
        "param": "page",
        "start": 1,
        "size_param": "pageSize",
        "size": 100,
        "mode": "page"
      },
      "results_key": "articles",
      "quota_is_daily": true
    },
    "ndl": {
      "base": "https://data.nasdaq.com",
      "auth": {
        "query": "api_key"
      },
      "key_env": [
        "NASDAQ_API_KEY",
        "NASDAQ_DATALINK_API_KEY",
        "NASDAQ_DATALINK_KEY",
        "QUANDL_API_KEY"
      ],
      "key_ssm": [
        "/justhodl/nasdaq-datalink/api-key"
      ],
      "rps": 2.0,
      "daily_call_cap": 3000,
      "paging": {
        "param": "page",
        "start": 1,
        "size_param": "per_page",
        "size": 100,
        "mode": "page"
      }
    },
    "cq": {
      "base": "https://api.cryptoquant.com",
      "auth": {
        "bearer": true
      },
      "key_env": [
        "CRYPTOQUANT_API_KEY"
      ],
      "key_ssm": [
        "/justhodl/cryptoquant_api",
        "/justhodl/cryptoquant/token"
      ],
      "rps": 1.5,
      "daily_call_cap": 2500,
      "paging": null,
      "results_key": "result.data"
    }
  },
